{"id":"eb16c7e7dda8fd7e","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing10-direct-extension.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Direct Extension","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-direct-extension — ZFC Forcing10 Direct Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-direct-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-direct-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-direct-extension — ZFC Forcing10 Direct Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-direct-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-direct-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-direct-extension — ZFC Forcing10 Direct Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d413862f4ab047c8\" href=\"?note=d413862f4ab047c8\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md\">../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (forcing-poset carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d413862f4ab047c8\" href=\"?note=d413862f4ab047c8\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md\">../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (forcing order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P^*\\subseteq\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P^*\\subseteq\\leq_P\\)</span> (designated direct-extension relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in P\">\\(p,q\\in P\\)</span> (conditions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DirectExtension}\">\\(\\operatorname{DirectExtension}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}direct\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\operatorname{DirectExtension}(q,p,P,\\leq_P,\\leq_P^*)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P^*)\\land\\leq_P^*\\subseteq\\leq_P\\land p,q\\in P\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}direct\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\operatorname{DirectExtension}(q,p,P,\\leq_P,\\leq_P^*)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P^*)\\land\\leq_P^*\\subseteq\\leq_P\\land p,q\\in P\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A direct extension is forcing-specific, so the designated stronger relation is an explicit argument.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md","status":"resolved","id":"d413862f4ab047c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[